## 5. ⛔ What this version does NOT do

It does not make the reproduction blind. It does not make measurement 4 confirmatory. **And it does
not make the ecosystem claim safe** — it makes it *conditional*, on a floor fixed in advance. If the
floor is not met, the claim is not available, and no reading of the result may restore it.
